{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And He commands</b> — Now He speaks to the king of Nineveh. The sense of וצוה is 'decreed.'" "<b>He shall not sow</b> — That his seed, called by his name, shall not endure." "<b>I will make your grave</b> — In the house of your elohim, as it says in the book of Kings: 'And it came to pass, as he was worshipping in the house of Nisroch his elohim, that there they struck him with the sword.'"], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:47.230893138Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}